{"1130380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "OZARK", "steam_appid": 1130380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/01aeb4755b6cbd6ebb56644c466577c5.poster.avif?t=1788214500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/01aeb4755b6cbd6ebb56644c466577c5.webm?t=1788214500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/01aeb4755b6cbd6ebb56644c466577c5.mp4?t=1788214500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE SIGNAL WAS ONLY THE BEGINNING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After crash landing in a remote mountain range in the far reaches of Northern Canada, you'll find yourself entering into a seemingly derelict facility where your partners signal was lost, and where nothing is quite as what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What started as a routine rescue and recovery mission slowly evolves into the fight of your life, surviving untold horrors while trying to unravel the mysteries and put an end to macabre human experimentation!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/15166e4364371988f892367afe8a19d7.poster.avif?t=1788214500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/15166e4364371988f892367afe8a19d7.webm?t=1788214500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/15166e4364371988f892367afe8a19d7.mp4?t=1788214500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INTENSE SIDE-SCROLLING ACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, fight, and survive through a fast-paced, story-driven side-scrolling experience. Battle your way through hostile environments, uncover the truth behind the facility, and face relentless horrors as the mission spirals into something far more deadly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/061cd5ef5bd3ce179357aebfcf6b3b97.poster.avif?t=1788214500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/061cd5ef5bd3ce179357aebfcf6b3b97.webm?t=1788214500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/061cd5ef5bd3ce179357aebfcf6b3b97.mp4?t=1788214500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFTED WITH COUCH CO-OP IN MIND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic couch co-op action in team duo. Work together and survive or die trying.     <br>Share items and help each other discover the secrets that lie beneath.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/151bd48b988ec7b4371fdff3a1b2ca58.poster.avif?t=1788214500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/151bd48b988ec7b4371fdff3a1b2ca58.webm?t=1788214500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/151bd48b988ec7b4371fdff3a1b2ca58.mp4?t=1788214500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OZARK is a a short (3-6 hour), dark, story-driven side-scrolling action game for one or two local players.</strong><br><br><strong><i>(Online co-op is played through Steam Remote Play)</i></strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/01aeb4755b6cbd6ebb56644c466577c5.poster.avif?t=1788214500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/01aeb4755b6cbd6ebb56644c466577c5.webm?t=1788214500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/01aeb4755b6cbd6ebb56644c466577c5.mp4?t=1788214500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE SIGNAL WAS ONLY THE BEGINNING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After crash landing in a remote mountain range in the far reaches of Northern Canada, you'll find yourself entering into a seemingly derelict facility where your partners signal was lost, and where nothing is quite as what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What started as a routine rescue and recovery mission slowly evolves into the fight of your life, surviving untold horrors while trying to unravel the mysteries and put an end to macabre human experimentation!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/15166e4364371988f892367afe8a19d7.poster.avif?t=1788214500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/15166e4364371988f892367afe8a19d7.webm?t=1788214500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/15166e4364371988f892367afe8a19d7.mp4?t=1788214500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INTENSE SIDE-SCROLLING ACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, fight, and survive through a fast-paced, story-driven side-scrolling experience. Battle your way through hostile environments, uncover the truth behind the facility, and face relentless horrors as the mission spirals into something far more deadly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/061cd5ef5bd3ce179357aebfcf6b3b97.poster.avif?t=1788214500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/061cd5ef5bd3ce179357aebfcf6b3b97.webm?t=1788214500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/061cd5ef5bd3ce179357aebfcf6b3b97.mp4?t=1788214500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFTED WITH COUCH CO-OP IN MIND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic couch co-op action in team duo. Work together and survive or die trying.     <br>Share items and help each other discover the secrets that lie beneath.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/151bd48b988ec7b4371fdff3a1b2ca58.poster.avif?t=1788214500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/151bd48b988ec7b4371fdff3a1b2ca58.webm?t=1788214500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/extras/151bd48b988ec7b4371fdff3a1b2ca58.mp4?t=1788214500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OZARK is a a short (3-6 hour), dark, story-driven side-scrolling action game for one or two local players.</strong><br><br><strong><i>(Online co-op is played through Steam Remote Play)</i></strong></h2>", "short_description": "OZARK is a dark, story-driven side-scrolling action horror game built for a short, intense playthrough. Crash-land in the remote mountains, enter a derelict facility, survive macabre human experimentation, and uncover what lies beneath. Play solo, online co-op, or couch co-op.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/f7c97c8df77d52cce3e165cb94331514d954ed13/header.jpg?t=1788214500", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/485206f217f7aa6eb38fb3fa2fdaf7f9652eb9ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788214500", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1130380/485206f217f7aa6eb38fb3fa2fdaf7f9652eb9ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788214500", "website": "https://www.alterboy.ca", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 780 or AMD Radeon RX 470<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4790 or AMD Ryzen 3 3200G<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Gr